      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Read the published roster"
      ],
      "text": "Read the published roster",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 5,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Read the published roster"
      ],
      "text": "Open My time > Schedule and choose Week or Month. Only Published shifts are binding; Draft shifts may still change. PeopleFlow displays start and end times in the workplace timezone. A shift ending after midnight shows its end date explicitly. Managers should publish the next week's roster by Thursday at 16:00 workplace time.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 6,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Propose an employee swap"
      ],
      "text": "Propose an employee swap",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 7,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Propose an employee swap"
      ],
      "text": "From 2026-09-01, employees initiate swaps in v2.0. The earlier v1.8 manager-initiated workflow is described only in PeopleFlow Release Notes v1.8.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 9,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Propose an employee swap"
      ],
      "text": "Select a published shift and choose Propose swap.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 10,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Propose an employee swap"
      ],
      "text": "Choose an eligible colleague's published shift and review both resulting assignments.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 11,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Propose an employee swap"
      ],
      "text": "Submit at least 24 hours before the earlier of the two shift starts.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 12,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Propose an employee swap"
      ],
      "text": "Wait for the colleague to accept within 12 hours of the proposal.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 13,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Propose an employee swap"
      ],
      "text": "After acceptance, wait for manager approval before following the changed roster.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 14,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Propose an employee swap"
      ],
      "text": "Acceptance by the colleague is not final authorization. The original assignments remain in force until the manager approves. A proposal expires after 12 hours without acceptance or when the earlier shift begins, whichever happens first. A withdrawn or rejected proposal does not modify either roster entry. An employee can withdraw before a manager decision.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 15,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Eligibility controls"
      ],
      "text": "Eligibility controls",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 16,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Eligibility controls"
      ],
      "text": "Both employees must belong to the same scheduling team, hold the required shift skill tags, and have no overlapping assignment. The resulting schedule must preserve 11 consecutive hours of rest between shifts and stay within each employee's contracted weekly hours unless separately approved overtime exists. SHIFT-422 identifies a failed eligibility rule; SHIFT-409 identifies a shift already involved in a pending swap. Resolve the active proposal rather than creating duplicates.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 17,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Manager completion"
      ],
      "text": "Manager completion",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 18,
        "line": null,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Shift Schedule & Swap Guide",
        "Manager completion"
      ],
      "text": "Managers use Manager Approval Dashboard to compare both sides of the swap and record a reason if they reject it. Approval updates both assignments atomically and notifies both participants. If only one side appears changed, refresh once and submit a support incident instead of manually trading another shift. The swap does not transfer leave approvals, overtime approvals, or payroll allowances. Those records require their own checks when the new assignment changes eligibility.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
